                "description": "The Aurora Lever with Square Rose is made out of sandcast bronze; and due to the casting process, each leverset is unique, with its own divots and pits that grant it a rustic end look. This Sandcast Aurora Leverset with #6 Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from a selection of traditional finishes for a look that mirrors your personal tastes.",
